{
  "id": "V11",
  "title": "Beam point supports — reaction only / over a wall end",
  "intent": "Beam BM-2 (0–12 ft) carries SW-7 (2–8 ft) on two Point supports. The support at x = 0 has nothing below it: its reaction is reported for external design (\"reaction only\" note) and leaves the load path. The support at x = 12 sits exactly on the left end of SW-8 below: that reaction is added to the SW-8 left end per combination, so its uplift drops and its compression changes; the SW-8 right end keeps its own values.",
  "covers": [
    "Point support types",
    "Reaction only (reported, excluded from the checks)",
    "Point support over a wall end → added to that end",
    "Per-combination superposition at a wall end"
  ],
  "handCalc": [
    {
      "step": 1,
      "text": "SW-7 (L = 6 ft, h = 9 ft, V = 2 k): D = 10 × 6 × 9 = 0.54 k → 0.27 k per end; N_E = 2 × 9 / 6 = ±3.00 k."
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "text": "BM-2 1.0D: R_b = (0.27 × 2 + 0.27 × 8) / 12 = 0.225 k; R_a = 0.54 − 0.225 = 0.315 k."
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "text": "BM-2 1.0E →: R_b = (−3.00 × 2 + 3.00 × 8) / 12 = 1.500 k; R_a = -1.500 k."
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "text": "Support a (x = 0, nothing below): reaction only. T = −(0.46 × 0.315 + 0.7 × (-1.500)) = 0.905 k; C = 1.14 × 0.315 + 0.7 × 1.500 = 1.409 k — design the support externally."
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "text": "SW-8 (Level 1, 12–22 ft, V = 5 k): D = 10 × 10 × 10 = 1.00 k → 0.50 k per end; N_E = 5 × 10 / 10 = ±5.00 k. Own (right end): T = 3.270 k, C = 4.070 k."
    },
    {
      "step": 6,
      "text": "SW-8 left end load cases incl. R_b: 1.0D = 0.50 + 0.225 = 0.725 k; 1.0E → = −5.00 + 1.500 = -3.500 k."
    },
    {
      "step": 7,
      "text": "SW-8 left end uplift, (0.6 − 0.14S_DS)D + 0.7E →: [0.46 × 0.50 − 0.7 × 5.00] + [0.46 × 0.225 + 0.7 × 1.500] = -2.117 → T = 2.117 k (was 3.270 k without the beam) → HDUE3."
    },
    {
      "step": 8,
      "text": "SW-8 left end compression, (1.0 + 0.14S_DS)D + 0.7E ←: [1.14 × 0.50 + 0.7 × 5.00] + [1.14 × 0.225 − 0.7 × 1.500] = 3.277 k → C = 3.277 k."
    },
    {
      "step": 9,
      "text": "Checks: the support-a reaction leaves the model (listed as reaction only → excluded); everything else reaches the foundation → G1–G12 pass."
    },
    {
      "step": 10,
      "text": "SW-7 (Eq. 4.3-1, → governs): v = 1000 × 2.000 / 6 = 333.33 plf, A = 10.5 in², G_a = 16 k/in → 8vh³/(EAb) = 0.0182; vh/(1000G_a) = 0.1875; uplift end T = 3000.00 lb (lateral); Δ_HD = δ_LRFD × T / T_LRFD = 0.097 × 3000.00 / 4386 = 0.0663 (MSTC40); r = 3000.00 / (10.5 × 625) = 0.4571 → Δ_c = 0.0125; h·Δa/b = 9 × (0.0663 + 0.0125) / 6 = 0.1183 → δ = 0.3240 in. (beam deflection under SW-7 not included, tool rule P5)"
    },
    {
      "step": 11,
      "text": "Story drift Roof: δxe = the largest wall δ = SW-7 0.3240 in → δx = Cd·δxe/Ie = 4 × 0.3240 / 1.0 = 1.296 in vs Δa = 0.020 × 9 × 12 = 2.160 in → OK."
    },
    {
      "step": 12,
      "text": "SW-8 1.0E → end forces for Eq. 4.3-1: left tension T = N_E − R_b,E = 5.000 − 1.500 = 3.500 k, right compression C = 5.000 k (← is the mirror). SW-8 (Eq. 4.3-1, ← governs): v = 1000 × 5.000 / 10 = 500.00 plf, A = 10.5 in², G_a = 20 k/in → 8vh³/(EAb) = 0.0224; vh/(1000G_a) = 0.2500; uplift end T = 5000.00 lb (lateral); Δ_HD = δ_LRFD × T / T_LRFD = 0.178 × 5000.00 / 5306 = 0.1677 (HDUE3); r = 3500.00 / (10.5 × 625) = 0.5333 → Δ_c = 0.0146; h·Δa/b = 10 × (0.1677 + 0.0146) / 10 = 0.1823 → δ = 0.4548 in."
    },
    {
      "step": 13,
      "text": "Story drift Level 1: δxe = the largest wall δ = SW-8 0.4548 in → δx = Cd·δxe/Ie = 4 × 0.4548 / 1.0 = 1.819 in vs Δa = 0.020 × 10 × 12 = 2.400 in → OK."
    }
  ],
